WEBVTT

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.329
Chabbage.
(*A vegetable in another world)

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.629
Botato!!!

00:01:43.359 --> 00:01:46.090
(The Farmer and the Guild)
Awesome! There's everything here.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:50.150
Al-kun, are you only interested in food?

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:52.510
That's because I'm a farmer.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.549
You just keep saying you're a farmer.

00:01:55.209 --> 00:01:55.920
That's...

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:56.569
What's wrong?

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.170
I'd like two skewers of green pippers and meat.
(*A vegetable in another world)

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:08.039
By the way, is it okay for a princess
to be hanging out here?

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.039
Won't you cause a sensation in the palace?

00:02:11.379 --> 00:02:12.259
Well,

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.650
my maid Irby is being my substitute. So, it's fine.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:20.639
Besides, it's also my duty
to know about the common people's life.

00:02:22.349 --> 00:02:25.150
But in my eyes, you're merely hanging around.

00:02:25.169 --> 00:02:28.199
It's also my duty to know about what the common people eat.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:29.759
Next, I want to eat that.

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:30.780
OK, OK.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:36.030
This is the Adventurers' Guild,
one of the several existing guilds.

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:39.830
Just to be clear, I don't want to be an adventurer.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:42.620
You want to be a farmer, right? I get it.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.009
Thanks.

00:02:44.889 --> 00:02:48.439
But you've given me land, so I must return the favor.

00:02:48.689 --> 00:02:50.729
(Princess Fal)
My identity must be kept a secret.

00:02:51.139 --> 00:02:53.030
(Felia)
Call me Felia from now on.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.009
(Felia)
I think you'll definitely be discovered.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.300
This hairpin has deception magic to help cover me up.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.159
I won't be exposed.

00:03:01.719 --> 00:03:02.770
Really?

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.689
Hmm.

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:09.539
Welcome.

00:03:10.229 --> 00:03:12.770
Oh? You're the rumored...

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.860
What? There are rumors about me?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.009
Welcome.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.750
Here. This is the reception for new members.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.509
Helen, he is here to register.

00:03:24.069 --> 00:03:26.259
Welcome to the Adventurers' Guild.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.830
Hello, I'm Al...

00:03:29.229 --> 00:03:30.729
(Rumble)

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.270
Are you hungry?

00:03:33.349 --> 00:03:34.479
(Rumble)

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.879
This way, please.

00:03:38.669 --> 00:03:40.500
I'm full.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.300
Thank you for the meal.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.330
It was so delicious.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.199
I'm glad you like it.

00:03:47.439 --> 00:03:49.460
I can make the best lorange pie.
(*A fruit in another world)

00:03:49.689 --> 00:03:53.259
Lorange. I'll try to grow some next time.

00:03:54.139 --> 00:03:57.889
Oh right, according to the form
you filled, your job is a farmer.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:02.379
Why do you want to be an adventurer, Al Wayne-kun?

00:04:02.789 --> 00:04:03.789
Well...

00:04:04.389 --> 00:04:08.259
Someone gave me some farmland
on the premise that I must help kill monsters.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:13.539
My main job is still a farmer but I intend
to be an adventurer on the side.

00:04:14.199 --> 00:04:16.600
I see. So, you must be quite good.

00:04:16.709 --> 00:04:18.550
No, not at all.

00:04:19.399 --> 00:04:20.529
You came here too.

00:04:20.689 --> 00:04:24.639
You're the one who beat the S-Rank
Forest Dragon with just one hit, right?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.379
S-Rank?

00:04:26.529 --> 00:04:27.189
He did?

00:04:27.189 --> 00:04:28.199
Who's this?

00:04:28.629 --> 00:04:30.540
- Awesome.
- Let me take a look.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.449
Forest Dragon.

00:04:32.029 --> 00:04:36.660
No, I'm just a farmer. I only threw a carrot at it.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.500
You are impressive for a farmer!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:43.490
If you need help, you may turn to them.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.009
I'm Al Wayne.

00:04:45.689 --> 00:04:48.160
Nice... Nice to meet you.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:49.569
I'm Jake.

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:52.540
I'm Lamia. Nice to meet you, Al.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:56.949
I'm Luke. We've been waiting
for a brave adventurer like you.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.670
Because Luke is too unreliable.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:00.560
Lamia.

00:05:00.819 --> 00:05:03.470
Luke is your senior. You should show him some respect.

00:05:05.319 --> 00:05:09.170
Al, let's fight the monsters for our country.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:13.259
No, I want to be a farmer for the rest of my life.

00:05:13.709 --> 00:05:14.899
OK.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.720
Still, let's fight monsters together. See you around.

00:05:19.329 --> 00:05:20.829
She wasn't listening to me.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.029
Alright, let's get a drink for celebration.

00:05:23.029 --> 00:05:25.019
- Let's drink until the next morning.
- Jake will pay.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:29.319
I feel like I'm getting farther away from my farm life.

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:31.610
You're amazing indeed.

00:05:31.769 --> 00:05:32.879
I'm flattered.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.310
Well, I'd like to try a quest.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:37.990
Well,

00:05:38.449 --> 00:05:43.430
you've just started at G-Rank,
so you can't take on difficult quests.

00:05:43.579 --> 00:05:44.800
G-Rank?

00:05:45.199 --> 00:05:49.279
The adventurers are ranked from G to SS.

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:53.560
That being said,
SS-Rank is actually exclusive for the heroes.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.009
So, the rank should be from G to S.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:56.920
Oh.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:01.569
By the way, when you reach C-Rank and B-Rank,
you'll be able to take quests alone.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.839
You seem quite capable.
Maybe you'll be promoted to S-Rank soon.

00:06:07.589 --> 00:06:10.649
I don't want to be promoted to S-Rank.
It'll be too eye-catching.

00:06:11.459 --> 00:06:13.579
How about starting with this quest?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.269
You are to collect 10 Melks from Grim Forest.

00:06:17.949 --> 00:06:18.990
Melk?

00:06:19.709 --> 00:06:23.990
The Melk is mainly used to make healing potions.
It's a necessity for adventurers.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.279
Oh, I see.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.899
The monsters in the forest and precautions are listed on it.

00:06:30.329 --> 00:06:31.170
I got it.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.600
By the way,

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:37.829
it's really dangerous to go to a place
full of monsters in that getup.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:41.569
I'm too poor to buy equipment.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.480
In that case,

00:06:44.139 --> 00:06:45.209
here you go.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.199
What is this?

00:06:46.269 --> 00:06:48.160
This is a robe infused with magic.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.240
It can moderately increase your defense.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.620
But...

00:06:52.629 --> 00:06:53.199
Here you go.

00:06:53.199 --> 00:06:53.970
No.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:54.699
Take it!

00:06:54.699 --> 00:06:56.300
A farmer doesn't need this.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.350
Just wear it.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.959
So forceful!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.750
It's okay. This robe has been set aside for a long time.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.800
Um, hello?

00:07:14.089 --> 00:07:15.019
Are you alright?

00:07:15.209 --> 00:07:21.310
I'm fine. I just find you looking a bit familiar.

00:07:22.949 --> 00:07:25.600
Never mind. This is a present for you.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:29.279
Anyway, I'm looking forward
to your performance as an adventurer.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.000
Sure enough, I'm getting farther away from the farm life.

00:07:32.879 --> 00:07:34.540
Thank you.

00:07:34.939 --> 00:07:35.889
Um...

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.810
I'm Helen Lin.

00:07:40.399 --> 00:07:42.680
Thank you, Helen-san.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.800
Not at all.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.560
Your identity really didn't get exposed.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.730
I told you it would be fine.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:59.110
But I can't possibly take a princess
to the Grim Forest where the monsters are.

00:07:59.589 --> 00:08:01.110
So, I have to say goodbye here.

00:08:02.089 --> 00:08:02.800
OK.

00:08:04.019 --> 00:08:06.439
I'll meet you tomorrow.

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:08.569
She'll come again tomorrow?

00:08:13.589 --> 00:08:15.649
The ninth one.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.319
I need 10. One more to go.

00:08:21.879 --> 00:08:22.930
What's that?

00:08:26.379 --> 00:08:27.300
A scale?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.430
There should be no scaly monsters nearby.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:35.559
It only mentions pixies, griffins and orcs.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.659
What do the red words say?

00:08:38.159 --> 00:08:39.240
About the orcs.

00:08:39.529 --> 00:08:41.570
Orcs breed quickly.

00:08:41.769 --> 00:08:46.289
They tend to attack their own species
and other human-form creatures.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.070
Oh, I'm glad I'm a man.

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:52.549
In addition, there are male and female orcs.

00:08:52.549 --> 00:08:54.789
So, men had better be careful too.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:00.570
No way, is this

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.779
the so-called female orc?

00:09:05.049 --> 00:09:07.480
Wait... Wait a minute!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.330
It stinks!

00:09:11.049 --> 00:09:12.480
Full Power Swing.

00:09:17.639 --> 00:09:18.809
I was saved!

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:22.220
Huh, Al?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:28.629
Jake-san, I appreciate your help.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.210
Don't be so reserved.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.610
Are you alright?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.659
I'm not reserved. And I'm fine.

00:09:36.889 --> 00:09:38.779
Hey, Jake!

00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:41.259
Looks like you've defeated it.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.820
Huh, Al?

00:09:43.139 --> 00:09:43.909
Hi.

00:09:44.539 --> 00:09:48.610
You got attacked by a female orc
on your first day. What bad luck!

00:09:48.789 --> 00:09:51.710
I thought the quest would be easy.

00:09:52.179 --> 00:09:55.570
Oh right, do you know what this is?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.909
Well,

00:09:57.049 --> 00:09:59.799
this should be a scale that is seldom dropped by

00:09:59.809 --> 00:10:01.870
a mysterious monster in the Grim Forest recently.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.679
A monster's scale?

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.240
Some say it's a black dragon's scale.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:09.700
But the black dragon only dwell
at the rivers in the highlands.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:14.090
Anyway, people have only found the scales
but not the dragon itself.

00:10:14.629 --> 00:10:18.659
But it seems to be of good quality. You may get
a good price for it, so that's pretty nice.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.080
Oh, OK.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:27.080
It's getting dark. We had better return to the town now.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.019
Have you finished your quest?

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.110
Not yet. I need one more Melk.

00:10:36.399 --> 00:10:37.409
What's that?

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:38.720
Is it a monster?

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:41.120
What kind of energy is this?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.120
It's a black dragon.

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.679
Is it the owner of the scale?

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.159
Doesn't it notice us?

00:11:29.019 --> 00:11:31.049
I should at least take a look at its status.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.990
What's this? What the hell...

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.730
It was a dream.

00:11:59.899 --> 00:12:03.399
Oh no, did I fall asleep in my uniform again?

00:12:08.909 --> 00:12:10.200
Good morning.

00:12:11.039 --> 00:12:14.659
What's wrong, Helen? You don't look well.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:19.879
Wong-san, actually, I seem to have a memory loss again.

00:12:20.299 --> 00:12:23.629
I can't remember what happened after I got home yesterday.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.970
Your condition has gotten more serious.

00:12:27.299 --> 00:12:30.429
Don't work today. Just go and see a doctor now.

00:12:31.059 --> 00:12:31.889
But...

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:35.690
I think you must have worked too hard and got too tired.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.480
You need to see a doctor.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:38.809
Got it?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.399
OK.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:41.940
Helen-san!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:43.820
Al-kun.

00:12:44.149 --> 00:12:45.360
How did the quest go?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.870
We'll get to that later. I have an urgent thing to report.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.409
It looks serious. I'll take you to meet the guild master.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.250
A black dragon appeared in the Grim Forest.

00:12:57.669 --> 00:13:02.500
Al has seen its status.
Its attack power seems to be 230,000.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.720
What? 230,000?

00:13:06.259 --> 00:13:09.009
Yeah, it can easily destroy our country.

00:13:09.549 --> 00:13:12.850
The dragon does look evil and ominous.

00:13:13.389 --> 00:13:16.230
It seems to be Ouroboros the Evil Dragon.

00:13:16.309 --> 00:13:17.440
Do you know anything about it?

00:13:17.559 --> 00:13:19.690
Ouroboros? Impossible.

00:13:19.899 --> 00:13:20.980
How can it appear here?

00:13:21.269 --> 00:13:23.730
Guild master, do you know about it?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.820
Ouroboros the Evil Dragon?

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.240
Helen!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:30.870
Are you OK?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.990
I'm sorry. I'm fine.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.200
Go take a rest over there.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.460
No, please let me stay. I want to hear about this.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:41.580
Helen-san.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.710
Do you have any other information?

00:13:44.919 --> 00:13:46.759
I'm sorry there's no more useful information.

00:13:47.549 --> 00:13:50.889
The Evil Dragon disappeared soon after passing us by.

00:13:51.549 --> 00:13:53.889
I almost fainted just by being near it.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.519
Only heroes can confront it.

00:13:57.019 --> 00:14:01.019
Anyway, I think we had better
cordon off the Grim Forest right away.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.690
OK.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:03.980
By the way,

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.990
I found this in the forest.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.320
It may be the Evil Dragon's scale.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.750
Nee-chan!

00:14:20.669 --> 00:14:22.460
Ley-kun, run!

00:14:22.789 --> 00:14:23.960
Nee-chan!

00:14:35.759 --> 00:14:36.470
Helen-san!

00:14:37.889 --> 00:14:38.600
Helen!

00:14:52.909 --> 00:14:54.820
Excuse me, how is Helen-san doing now?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.740
She's fine. She just had a blackout.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Oh, good to hear it.

00:14:59.659 --> 00:15:02.460
I'm Wong Lin, Helen's foster mother.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.129
Who are you?

00:15:04.379 --> 00:15:06.710
I'm Al Wayne. I'm a farmer.

00:15:07.049 --> 00:15:09.129
Oh, the robe you're wearing...

00:15:11.299 --> 00:15:13.220
Helen-san gave it to me.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.179
Oh, I see.

00:15:15.299 --> 00:15:17.470
Is there anything wrong with this?

00:15:17.559 --> 00:15:21.059
No, I'm just a bit surprised.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.899
She has no memories of her childhood.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:27.070
What?

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:32.320
All she remembered was her name
and the only thing she had was that robe.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:38.450
15 years ago,
my husband and I found her lying by the Snus River.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.039
It didn't seem like she had a family.

00:15:41.159 --> 00:15:42.710
So, we adopted her.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.710
So far, she still can't recall the past.

00:15:48.039 --> 00:15:49.340
That's quite a shock.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.840
Maybe it has something to do
with the dragon called Ouroboros.

00:15:53.879 --> 00:15:55.639
I'll look into this.

00:15:56.009 --> 00:15:56.679
What?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.929
I'm the one who saw its status.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.389
Maybe I can figure out something.

00:16:01.019 --> 00:16:03.940
Besides, it's too dangerous to leave it alone.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:08.860
You're only G-Rank. I cannot
let you do something so dangerous.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.240
Leave it to the S-Rank adventurers and soldiers.

00:16:12.529 --> 00:16:15.110
It's okay. I won't go into the Grim Forest.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.909
I'll go to the library and ask around.

00:16:18.779 --> 00:16:20.830
I want to help.

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:22.830
You...

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:24.580
Wait a minute.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.340
These are healing potions.
Just take them as an advance payment.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.840
Please keep me updated if you find anything.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.379
I'll reward you.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.549
OK.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:39.299
Al-san.

00:16:39.549 --> 00:16:41.389
Finally, there you are. Here's a letter for you.

00:16:41.509 --> 00:16:42.850
What? A letter for me?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.350
Mom?!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.730
I haven't told her about me
moving into the royal capital. How did she know?

00:16:49.269 --> 00:16:50.690
I've delivered the letter to you.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.610
Oh, thank you.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.779
Not at all. It's my job. Goodbye.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.200
I'm Ricks, a postman.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.369
Thank you.

00:17:04.579 --> 00:17:05.250
Goodbye!

00:17:06.539 --> 00:17:07.250
Well,

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.039
how did the postman know I'm here?

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:18.720
I want to help, that's what I said.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.720
But I just can't find any useful clues.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.019
Its attack power is 230,000.

00:17:25.349 --> 00:17:27.690
The SS-Rank adventurer's maximum power is 1,000.

00:17:28.059 --> 00:17:30.519
The one I defeated, Romeo was only at 5,000.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.319
And mine is 50,000. I'm no match for it at all.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.980
If it comes to attack this place,

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.609
within a blink of an eye...

00:17:39.779 --> 00:17:44.039
Oh right, Wong-san said she found Helen 15 years ago.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.369
I should check the damage report from back then.

00:17:48.539 --> 00:17:51.789
I'm sorry. You have no access to it.

00:17:52.089 --> 00:17:52.710
What?

00:17:52.839 --> 00:17:57.720
Why? Is this bullying? Is it a scheme,
or a measure to prevent giving away secrets?

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:03.259
The damage report is only accessible
to people of certain ranks.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.559
Why? Why?

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:08.480
Why?

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:10.059
Can you please bend the rules for me?

00:18:10.099 --> 00:18:11.599
Stop badgering here.

00:18:11.849 --> 00:18:13.019
Or I'll sue you.

00:18:13.269 --> 00:18:15.109
I have the right to access it.

00:18:18.819 --> 00:18:20.950
Your Highness!

00:18:21.569 --> 00:18:23.490
Fal, why are you here?

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.490
When I got to the guild,
I was told you came to the library.

00:18:26.789 --> 00:18:28.539
Oh, I see.

00:18:28.539 --> 00:18:32.000
Can you allow him access
to the report with my permission?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:36.589
Of course, you may go inside together.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.210
Did you hear that?

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.880
Yeah. That's just what I need.

00:18:40.359 --> 00:18:41.160
High five!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:41.640
Yay!

00:18:45.559 --> 00:18:48.430
So, what do you want to look into?

00:18:49.309 --> 00:18:51.640
The damage report from 15 years ago.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:52.900
Where is the location?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.150
It should be by the Snus River.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.480
Could it be Honoru Village?

00:18:57.819 --> 00:18:58.609
Honoru Village?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:18:59.819
This is it.

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.029
Al-kun, are you determined to be an adventurer now?

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.160
No, absolutely not.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.539
Then why are you doing this?

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:11.619
Someone is in trouble. Of course I can't leave her alone.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.130
Al-kun.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.049
Found it.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:21.170
15 years ago, Honoru Village was exterminated.

00:19:21.799 --> 00:19:26.430
A merchant visited Honoru Village for business.

00:19:26.599 --> 00:19:31.309
He found that place had been utterly destroyed and in ruins.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.059
He seemed to have investigated
the scales he picked up at the village.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.440
Scales.

00:19:37.059 --> 00:19:37.869
He concluded that

00:19:37.869 --> 00:19:40.009
the scales might belong to Ouroboros the Evil Dragon,

00:19:40.019 --> 00:19:43.400
which should have been annihilated a long time ago.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.569
Ouroboros the Evil Dragon.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.250
It's said that Ouroboros feeds on destruction and despair.

00:19:51.289 --> 00:19:53.960
It is an eternal existence.

00:19:54.369 --> 00:19:55.789
However, according to Naturalis Historia,

00:19:55.960 --> 00:20:02.799
its body perished in a battle against its only enemy,
Mirage the Holy Dragon.

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:04.430
Is it dead?

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:07.049
But why did the Evil Dragon's scales drop here?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:12.230
If the Evil Dragon comes back to life,
the whole world will be in danger.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:16.650
So, for the sake of stability,
this matter has been kept confidential?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.109
I don't know about this even though I'm a princess.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:20.980
Honoru Village?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:25.529
It's too late to go now. I'll go take a look tomorrow.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.069
Yeah. OK.

00:20:28.119 --> 00:20:28.910
What?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.450
You're coming too?

00:20:36.289 --> 00:20:37.119
This way, right?

00:20:44.009 --> 00:20:44.920
Is this the right place?

00:20:45.549 --> 00:20:46.509
It's too horrible to see.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.890
It's in total ruins, just like 15 years ago.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.809
OK, hopefully, we can find some clues.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.730
Hey, sir!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.309
Here!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.480
What's that voice?

00:20:59.769 --> 00:21:03.029
Al-kun, wait! What's wrong?

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:09.029
Come here. Here. I'm here.

00:21:10.319 --> 00:21:11.079
I'm right here.

00:21:14.039 --> 00:21:16.329
You can hear me!

00:21:16.829 --> 00:21:17.829
Of course.

00:21:18.079 --> 00:21:21.789
Hey, Al-kun, what's wrong? What are you talking about?

00:21:22.299 --> 00:21:23.250
Al-kun?

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.920
Do you like muttering to yourself?

00:21:26.259 --> 00:21:27.630
No, I'm talking to this kid.

00:21:27.799 --> 00:21:29.299
Ah, the kid.

00:21:29.589 --> 00:21:30.470
Where is it?

00:21:30.849 --> 00:21:33.559
What? You can't see him?

00:21:33.849 --> 00:21:34.769
I can't see anyone else here.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:39.480
Are you a ghost?

00:21:40.019 --> 00:21:42.519
Yes, my name is Ley.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:47.190
I've been waiting here for someone who can hear me.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:38.059
(Episode 3: The Farmer and Ouroboros the Evil Dragon)
